XZ Embedded, unmodified, from https://github.com/tukaani-project/xz-embedded
commit ae63ae3a36ed01724674e8f3d750dc47bf125410 (2024-12-30), license 0BSD
(COPYING): linux/lib/xz/{xz_private.h,xz_stream.h,xz_lzma2.h,xz_dec_lzma2.c,
xz_dec_stream.c,xz_crc32.c} and linux/include/linux/xz.h. The build sets it up
through ../xz_config.h, in place of the upstream userspace one.
